== Design rationale ==
  Actor only needs to make 3 decisions per station: platform, entry, dwell.
  This requires knowing (a) own state, (b) next station congestion,
  (c) current resource availability. It does NOT need:
  - Per-platform occupancy bitmaps (15 dims) -> replaced with counts
  - Per-conflict-group status (40 dims) -> handled by resolver
  - Per-neighbor detailed state (40 dims) -> competitive outcome is resolver's job
  - Position/speed placeholders (2 dims) -> always zero in Python sim

