  Previous iterations drifted from V4 spec: _force_policy=True (all trains
  used policy), resolver auto-fallback removed, deadlock per-agent instead
  of global, penalties too aggressive. Policy was being asked to learn
  global coordination (resolver's job) instead of individual re-scheduling
