== V4 design (restored) ==
  Per V4 spec section "Layer 2 - Local Competition":
  - L2 activates ONLY when disturbances detected (NOMINAL path otherwise)
  - Resolver handles conflicts with fallback degradation (2 attempts max)
  - Deadlock = all pending trains NO_LEGAL_ACTION for 15 consecutive steps
  - Reward: moderate coefficients (delay_coef=0.02, held=-3.0, ONTIME=2.0)

